# https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/Clef-Flash-GGUF  (Apache-2.0)
# llama/    holds the llama.cpp CUDA release build (needs >= b11364 for `clef`)
models/
llama/
*.gguf

# Downloaded release archives (llama.cpp zips, ~625 MB)
